    LLM: 'Bid only in suits with enough depth, and choose a target card that can realistically form a high-value triple or four-of-a-kind.\n\nTrack the cards, suits, or resources that control the next legal plays, and avoid giving opponents a simple route to their scoring condition.\n\nUse memory and tempo to force opponents into inefficient plays while preserving cards or resources that complete your own plan.',
